From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] before-build-linux: accept Rocky Linux

scripts/before-build-linux.sh dispatches on /etc/os-release's ID and
exits 1 on any distribution it does not list. manylinux_2_28 is
AlmaLinux 8, but manylinux_2_39 (the only manylinux image published for
riscv64) is Rocky Linux 10, whose ID is "rocky", so the script aborts
before ICU is built. Rocky takes exactly the AlmaLinux path: dnf for
wget, then ld.so.conf + ldconfig for the ICU prefix.

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not submitted from this automated port run; needs a pull request against Init7/pyicu]
---
 scripts/before-build-linux.sh | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/scripts/before-build-linux.sh b/scripts/before-build-linux.sh
index 8d05caa..57f054f 100755
--- a/scripts/before-build-linux.sh
+++ b/scripts/before-build-linux.sh
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@ case "${ID}" in
     yum install -y wget
     ;;

-  almalinux)
+  almalinux|rocky)
     dnf -y install wget
     ;;

@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@ fi

 # NOTE: configure library search paths
 case "${ID}" in
-  almalinux|centos)
+  almalinux|centos|rocky)
     echo "${_LIBICU_DIR}/lib" >> /etc/ld.so.conf
     ldconfig
     ;;
--
2.43.0
